WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.653 --> 00:00:14.357
&gt;&gt; Tucker: GOOD EVENING AND

00:00:12.321 --> 00:00:15.057
WELCOME TO

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.926
"TUCKER CARLSON TONIGHT" ."

00:00:15.191 --> 00:00:17.627
BRETT KAVANAUGH JUST FINISHED

00:00:17.059 --> 00:00:21.631
SPEAKING WITH MARTHA MacCALLUM

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:24.600
AND HE PUSHED BACK AND DENIED

00:00:21.764 --> 00:00:25.201
COMPLETELY ALL OF THE ALEX

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:26.335
ALLEGATIONS AGAINST HIM.

00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:28.504
IN DOING THAT HE HAD TIMES

00:00:26.769 --> 00:00:29.205
PROVIDED A LEVEL OF INFORMATION

00:00:28.638 --> 00:00:32.141
ABOUT HIS PERSONAL LIFE THAT

00:00:29.338 --> 00:00:34.644
WOULD HAVE BEEN THINKABLE JUST

00:00:32.275 --> 00:00:35.778
DAYS AGO.

00:00:34.777 --> 00:00:39.649
&gt;&gt; Martha: THROUGH ALL THESE

00:00:35.912 --> 00:00:40.883
YEARS IN QUESTION, YOU WERE A?

00:00:39.782 --> 00:00:43.086
&gt;&gt; THAT'S CORRECT.

00:00:41.017 --> 00:00:44.120
&gt;&gt; SO NEVER HAD INTERCOURSE WITH

00:00:43.219 --> 00:00:44.821
ANYONE IN HIGH SCHOOL AND

00:00:44.253 --> 00:00:47.891
COLLEGE SINCE WE ARE PROBING

00:00:44.954 --> 00:00:49.359
INTO THAT?

00:00:48.024 --> 00:00:51.861
&gt;&gt; MANY YEARS AFTER, I WILL

00:00:49.492 --> 00:00:53.263
LEAVE IT AT THAT.

00:00:51.995 --> 00:00:54.264
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NOT YOUR

00:00:53.396 --> 00:00:55.532
CONVENTIONAL INTERVIEW.

00:00:54.397 --> 00:00:56.266
HE WAS ASKED REPEATEDLY ABOUT

00:00:55.665 --> 00:00:59.035
ALLEGATIONS AGAINST HIM AND HIS

00:00:56.399 --> 00:00:59.702
WIFE SAT BY HIM AS HE DENIED ALL

00:00:59.168 --> 00:01:04.040
OF THEM.

00:00:59.836 --> 00:01:06.676
&gt;&gt; ARE NOT TO LET FALLS

00:01:04.173 --> 00:01:07.010
ACCUSATIONS DRIVE US OUT OF THIS

00:01:06.809 --> 00:01:10.547
PROCESS.

00:01:07.143 --> 00:01:15.118
WE ARE LOOKING FOR A FAIR

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:16.286
PROCESS WHERE YOU CAN HEAR MY

00:01:15.251 --> 00:01:17.120
LIFELONG RECORD.

00:01:16.419 --> 00:01:19.089
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NOBODY EXPECTED

00:01:17.253 --> 00:01:19.789
ANYTHING LIKE THIS WHEN THAT

00:01:19.222 --> 00:01:23.760
CONFIRMATION PROCESS STARTED.

00:01:19.923 --> 00:01:24.461
WE WILL HAVE MORE FROM MARTHA'S

00:01:23.893 --> 00:01:26.896
INTERVIEW AND MARTHA WILL JOIN

00:01:25.762 --> 00:01:29.499
US ON THE SET LATER ON TO TELL

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:29.866
US WHAT IT WAS LIKE IN THAT

00:01:29.632 --> 00:01:32.068
ROOM.

00:01:29.999 --> 00:01:32.902
BUT WE TYPICALLY OPEN THIS HOUR

00:01:32.202 --> 00:01:33.336
BY TALKING WITH SOMEONE THAT WE

00:01:33.036 --> 00:01:36.306
DISAGREE WITH.

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:38.108
WE AGREE WITH STRAIGHTFORWARD

00:01:36.439 --> 00:01:38.942
DEBATE ON THE SHOW.

00:01:38.241 --> 00:01:40.310
AMERICANS HAVE BEEN TALKING TO

00:01:39.075 --> 00:01:42.278
THEIR DIFFERENCES FOR MANY YEARS

00:01:40.443 --> 00:01:44.481
AND IT'S WORKED PRETTY WELL.

00:01:42.412 --> 00:01:45.982
WE FEEL THAT WE HAVE WISER

00:01:44.981 --> 00:01:46.449
DECISIONS WHEN BOTH SIDES GET TO

00:01:46.116 --> 00:01:49.519
HAVE THEIR SAY.

00:01:46.583 --> 00:01:49.853
BUT TONIGHT, WE WILL PAUSE FOR A

00:01:49.653 --> 00:01:50.920
MINUTE.

00:01:49.986 --> 00:01:52.956
WE WILL INVITE GUESTS ON LATER

00:01:51.054 --> 00:01:54.257
IN THE HOUR BUT FIRST THOUGH

00:01:53.089 --> 00:01:55.892
IT'S WORTH IT TO CONSIDER

00:01:54.391 --> 00:01:57.460
LEARNING WHAT WE'VE LEARNED FROM

00:01:56.026 --> 00:01:58.328
BRETT KAVANAUGH'S CONSIDERATION

00:01:57.594 --> 00:01:59.129
FOR SUPREME COURT.

00:01:58.461 --> 00:02:02.565
IT FEELS LIKE A TURNING POINT,

00:01:59.262 --> 00:02:06.336
SOMETHING NEW IN THIS COUNTRY.

00:02:02.699 --> 00:02:07.070
WE CERTAINLY HAD CONTROVERSIAL

00:02:06.469 --> 00:02:09.139
DEBATES.

00:02:07.203 --> 00:02:10.473
ROBERT BORK, CLARENCE THOMAS AND

00:02:09.272 --> 00:02:11.274
MANY OTHERS.

00:02:10.607 --> 00:02:13.677
SHORTLY AFTER BEING ELECTED

00:02:11.408 --> 00:02:14.444
PRESIDENT IN 1936,

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:16.646
FRANKLIN ROOSEVELT TRIED TO TAKE

00:02:14.578 --> 00:02:19.583
OVER THE ENTIRE JUDICIAL BRANCH

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:22.085
OF GOVERNMENT SO HE COULD IMPOSE

00:02:19.716 --> 00:02:22.486
HIS PROGRAM ON CONGRESS BY

00:02:22.219 --> 00:02:25.288
FORCE.

00:02:22.619 --> 00:02:26.490
THANKFULLY FDR FAILED IN THAT.

00:02:25.422 --> 00:02:28.291
THE POINT IS, POLITICS HAS

00:02:26.623 --> 00:02:29.292
ALWAYS INTRUDED ON OUR JUSTICE

00:02:28.425 --> 00:02:30.527
SYSTEM.

00:02:29.426 --> 00:02:32.729
CONGRESS CONFIRMS THE NOMINEE IS

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:34.498
SO INHERENTLY POLITICAL.

00:02:32.863 --> 00:02:35.699
YET SOME OF THIS WE HAVE NOT

00:02:34.631 --> 00:02:36.900
SEEN BEFORE.

00:02:35.832 --> 00:02:38.902
IT IS ENTIRELY NEW.

00:02:37.034 --> 00:02:40.470
NEVER IN OUR LIFETIMES HAVE

00:02:39.036 --> 00:02:43.073
SITTING MEMBERS OF CONGRESS

00:02:40.604 --> 00:02:44.508
ATTACKED OUR JUSTICE SYSTEM AS

00:02:43.206 --> 00:02:45.709
THEY NOW ARE.

00:02:44.641 --> 00:02:48.011
LAWMAKERS HAVEN'T NOT MOCKED THE

00:02:45.842 --> 00:02:50.280
IDEA OF DUE PROCESS WERE CALLED

00:02:48.779 --> 00:02:51.882
FOR THE COLLECTIVE PUNISHMENT OR

00:02:50.414 --> 00:02:53.383
DECLARED TO THE BURDEN OF PROOF

00:02:52.015 --> 00:02:54.918
IS ON THE ACCUSED RATHER THAN

00:02:53.517 --> 00:02:56.286
THE ACCUSER.

00:02:55.052 --> 00:02:57.688
ALL OF THAT IS HAPPENING RIGHT

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:59.289
NOW IN WASHINGTON AND MORE.

00:02:57.821 --> 00:03:00.857
IT'S NOT JUST BRETT KAVANAUGH

00:02:59.423 --> 00:03:02.092
UNDER ASSAULT, ELECTED OFFICIALS

00:03:00.991 --> 00:03:04.294
HAVE ANNOUNCED THEY NO LONGER

00:03:02.226 --> 00:03:05.095
BELIEVE IN OUR WESTERN

00:03:04.428 --> 00:03:07.097
UNDERSTANDING OF JUSTICE.

00:03:05.229 --> 00:03:08.098
IT IS NO PRESIDENT OF THAT HERE,

00:03:07.598 --> 00:03:09.299
IT'S STUNNING.

00:03:08.232 --> 00:03:10.901
YOU SHOULD PAY CLOSE ATTENTION

00:03:09.433 --> 00:03:12.135
TO WHAT IS HAPPENING BECAUSE IT

00:03:11.034 --> 00:03:14.004
COULD AFFECT ALL OF US.

00:03:12.269 --> 00:03:16.540
THIS SHIFT BEGAN LATE LAST WEEK

00:03:14.137 --> 00:03:17.007
WITH THESE REMARKS FROM THE

00:03:16.673 --> 00:03:19.443
HAWAII SENATOR.

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:21.044
&gt;&gt; I JUST WANT TO SAY TO THE MEN

00:03:19.576 --> 00:03:23.847
OF THIS COUNTRY, SHUT UP AND

00:03:21.178 --> 00:03:25.082
STEP UP, DO THE RIGHT THING FOR

00:03:23.981 --> 00:03:27.017
A CHANGE.

00:03:25.215 --> 00:03:28.085
NOT ONLY DO WOMEN LIKE DR. FORD

00:03:27.151 --> 00:03:33.324
WHO BRAVELY COMES FORWARD NEED

00:03:28.218 --> 00:03:34.692
TO BE HEARD, BUT THEY NEED TO BE

00:03:33.457 --> 00:03:36.894
BELIEVED.

00:03:34.825 --> 00:03:39.897
BE ONE SO THERE YOU HAVE IT, ALL

00:03:37.027 --> 00:03:40.898
MEN ARE TO BELIEVED, NOT BECAUSE

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:42.066
THEY ARE PROVED GUILTY BUT

00:03:41.031 --> 00:03:44.468
BECAUSE THEY ARE MEN AND THEY

00:03:42.199 --> 00:03:44.802
ARE INHERENTLY GUILTY BY THEIR

00:03:44.602 --> 00:03:46.637
NATURE.

00:03:44.969 --> 00:03:51.442
ALL WOMEN ARE TO BE BELIEVE IT'S

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:53.143
BECAUSE THEY ARE FEMALE, AND ALL

00:03:51.609 --> 00:03:54.144
THAT MATTERS IS DNA.

00:03:53.277 --> 00:03:55.279
ALL OF US ARE CONDEMNED OR

00:03:54.278 --> 00:03:57.081
REDEEMED AT BIRTH AND THERE IS

00:03:55.412 --> 00:03:58.949
NOTHING ANY OF US CAN DO TO

00:03:57.214 --> 00:03:59.483
CHANGE THAT, IT'S BAKED IN THE

00:03:59.083 --> 00:04:01.118
CAKE.

00:03:59.617 --> 00:04:03.654
THAT'S WHAT SHE SAID.

00:04:01.252 --> 00:04:05.289
NO LIVING U.S. SENATOR HAS EVER

00:04:03.787 --> 00:04:06.323
INSIDE ANYTHING LIKE THAT IN

00:04:05.422 --> 00:04:10.761
PUBLIC BUT NONE OF THOSE

00:04:06.457 --> 00:04:15.466
DEMOCRATIC COLLEAGUES WERE

00:04:10.895 --> 00:04:17.601
SPOILED OR WRONG.

00:04:15.766 --> 00:04:20.171
SHE KEPT GOING AND HE OR SHE IS

00:04:17.735 --> 00:04:22.006
FROM OVER THE WEEKEND.

00:04:20.371 --> 00:04:23.407
&gt;&gt; DOESN'T KAVANAUGH HAVE THE

00:04:22.139 --> 00:04:24.308
SAME PRESUMPTION OF INNOCENCE AS

00:04:23.541 --> 00:04:26.410
EVERYONE ELSE IN AMERICA?

00:04:24.442 --> 00:04:28.079
&gt;&gt; I PUT HIS DENIAL IN THE

00:04:26.544 --> 00:04:30.781
CONTEXT OF EVERYTHING THAT I

00:04:28.446 --> 00:04:32.750
KNOW ABOUT HIM IN TERMS OF HOW

00:04:30.915 --> 00:04:34.685
HE PURCHASES CASES.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:35.086
&gt;&gt; GIVE HER CREDIT FOR

00:04:34.819 --> 00:04:37.621
DIRECTNESS.

00:04:35.219 --> 00:04:38.489
BRETT KAVANAUGH IS NOT PROTECTED

00:04:37.755 --> 00:04:38.923
BY THE UNITED STATES

00:04:38.622 --> 00:04:41.492
CONSTITUTION.

00:04:39.056 --> 00:04:42.126
HE DOES NOT ENJOY THE

00:04:41.625 --> 00:04:44.862
PRESUMPTION OF INNOCENCE.

00:04:42.259 --> 00:04:46.897
KAVANAUGH IS GUILTY BECAUSE HIS

00:04:44.995 --> 00:04:47.498
OPPONENTS SAY HE IS GUILTY AND

00:04:47.031 --> 00:04:49.300
THAT IS HER POSITION.

00:04:47.631 --> 00:04:50.935
SHE'S PROUD OF IT AND SHE HAS

00:04:49.433 --> 00:04:51.569
BECOME A FOLK HERO ON THE LEFT

00:04:51.068 --> 00:04:53.771
FOR SAYING THAT.

00:04:51.702 --> 00:04:54.472
WATCH OR SAY IT AGAIN FROM

00:04:53.904 --> 00:04:56.774
EARLIER TODAY.

00:04:54.605 --> 00:04:57.074
&gt;&gt; CAN YOU CLARIFY WHAT YOU

00:04:56.907 --> 00:04:59.010
MEANT?

00:04:57.208 --> 00:05:01.078
DO YOU BELIEVE JUDGE KAVANAUGH

00:04:59.143 --> 00:05:01.579
DESERVES PRESUMPTION OF

00:05:01.212 --> 00:05:03.547
INNOCENCE, OR NOT?

00:05:01.712 --> 00:05:05.883
&gt;&gt; WE ARE NOT IN A COURT OF LAW,

00:05:03.681 --> 00:05:07.084
WE ARE ACTUALLY IN A COURT OF

00:05:06.017 --> 00:05:09.086
CREDIBILITY AT THIS POINT AND

00:05:07.218 --> 00:05:11.088
WITHOUT HAVING THE FBI REPORT OR

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:11.822
SOME SEMBLANCE OF TRYING TO GET

00:05:11.222 --> 00:05:16.294
CORROBORATION, WE ARE LEFT WITH

00:05:11.956 --> 00:05:16.661
THE CREDIBILITY OF THE TWO

00:05:16.427 --> 00:05:19.397
WITNESSES.

00:05:16.794 --> 00:05:21.966
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OH, A COURT OF

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:23.367
CREDIBILITY.

00:05:22.266 --> 00:05:26.404
SHE DIDN'T EXPLAIN WHAT THE

00:05:23.501 --> 00:05:27.705
COURT OF CREDIBILITY IS, BUT YOU

00:05:26.537 --> 00:05:29.707
CAN BE ASSURED THAT YOU NEVER

00:05:27.838 --> 00:05:31.042
WANT TO BE TRIED IN ONE.

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:32.143
IF THE BILL OF RIGHTS DOESN'T

00:05:31.175 --> 00:05:33.477
APPLY TO BRETT KAVANAUGH, IT

00:05:32.276 --> 00:05:33.811
PROBABLY DOESN'T APPLY TO YOU

00:05:33.611 --> 00:05:37.281
EITHER.

00:05:33.945 --> 00:05:39.317
IT ALL DEPENDS ON WHAT MAZIE

00:05:37.415 --> 00:05:40.284
HIRONO THINKS OF YOUR POLITICAL

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:42.587
VIEWS.

00:05:40.418 --> 00:05:43.955
KEEP IN MIND THAT ONCE YOU'VE

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:45.490
BEEN ACCUSED IN THIS NEW COURT

00:05:44.088 --> 00:05:46.691
OF CREDIBILITY YOU ARE

00:05:45.623 --> 00:05:47.692
RESPONSIBLE FOR PROVING YOURSELF

00:05:46.824 --> 00:05:49.294
INNOCENT.

00:05:47.825 --> 00:05:49.661
IT'S YOUR JOB TO UNCONVICT

00:05:49.427 --> 00:05:51.162
YOURSELF.

00:05:49.794 --> 00:05:53.164
THAT SOUNDS LIKE A MIRROR IMAGE

00:05:51.296 --> 00:05:54.499
OF OUR ACTUAL JUSTICE SYSTEM AND

00:05:53.298 --> 00:05:56.501
YOU ARE RIGHT, IT IS.

00:05:54.632 --> 00:05:58.002
FOR MORE THAN A THOUSAND YEARS,

00:05:56.634 --> 00:06:00.104
THE BURDEN OF PROOF HAS FALLEN

00:05:58.136 --> 00:06:00.705
ON THE ACCUSER WHICH IN OUR

00:06:00.238 --> 00:06:01.940
COUNTRY AS A GOVERNMENT.

00:06:00.838 --> 00:06:04.776
IF THEY SAY YOU DID IT, YOU HAVE

00:06:02.073 --> 00:06:10.548
TO PROVE THAT YOU HAVE DONE IT.

00:06:04.909 --> 00:06:12.283
HERE IS SENATOR BLUMENTHAL AND

00:06:10.682 --> 00:06:12.584
EXPLAINING HOW THE NEW SYSTEM

00:06:12.417 --> 00:06:14.085
WORKS.

00:06:12.717 --> 00:06:16.554
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE A CONSTITUTIONAL DUTY

00:06:14.219 --> 00:06:16.955
TO GET TO THE BOTTOM OF THESE

00:06:16.688 --> 00:06:19.290
ALLEGATIONS.

00:06:17.088 --> 00:06:20.558
THEY ARE SERIOUS AND CREDIBLE

00:06:19.424 --> 00:06:25.630
AND IT NOW THE PERSON WITH THE

00:06:20.692 --> 00:06:27.866
MOST KNOWLEDGE ABOUT THEM,

00:06:25.763 --> 00:06:32.637
NAMELY JUDGE BRETT KAVANAUGH, AS

00:06:28.032 --> 00:06:34.372
A RESPONSIBILITY, AS EVIDENCE TO

00:06:32.770 --> 00:06:38.309
REVIVE THEM.

00:06:34.506 --> 00:06:38.810
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOUR JOB IS TO SHOW

00:06:38.443 --> 00:06:40.278
YOU ARE INNOCENT.

00:06:38.943 --> 00:06:42.313
SENATOR BLUMENTHAL WENT TO YALE

00:06:40.411 --> 00:06:43.681
LAW SCHOOL, THAT HE LEARNED THAT

00:06:42.447 --> 00:06:46.418
IN HIS CLASSES THERE?

00:06:43.848 --> 00:06:49.087
IT'S A NEW IDEA BUT ALSO A VERY

00:06:46.551 --> 00:06:49.954
OLD IDEA WHICH WAS COMMON FOR

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:52.691
THE ACCUSED HAD A RESPONSIBILITY

00:06:50.088 --> 00:06:54.459
TO COME FORWARD TO ABOUT THE

00:06:52.824 --> 00:06:55.126
CHARGES AGAINST THEM.

00:06:54.592 --> 00:06:57.095
HERETICS WHO SURVIVE TORTURE

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:59.364
SOMETIMES GOT DECLARED INNOCENT,

00:06:57.228 --> 00:07:00.265
BUT THERE IS A FLIP SIDE TO THE

00:06:59.497 --> 00:07:02.267
NEW SYSTEM.

00:07:00.398 --> 00:07:03.702
BECAUSE THE ACCUSER GUILTY BY

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:05.537
DEFINITION, THE ACCUSER SUDDENLY

00:07:03.835 --> 00:07:06.004
HAS NO RESPONSIBILITY TO MAKE

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:08.840
CREDIBLE CLAIMS.

00:07:06.137 --> 00:07:09.240
WE ARE SEEING THAT PRINCIPLE IN

00:07:08.973 --> 00:07:10.775
ACTION, TOO.

00:07:09.374 --> 00:07:11.076
WE COVERED THE STORY ALL LAST

00:07:10.909 --> 00:07:12.877
WEEK.

00:07:11.209 --> 00:07:14.479
FIVE NIGHTS IN A ROW WE SAID WE

00:07:13.011 --> 00:07:15.080
ARE GIVING CHRISTINE FORD EVERY

00:07:14.613 --> 00:07:17.282
BENEFIT OF EVERY DOUBT.

00:07:15.213 --> 00:07:18.684
AND WE DID THAT.

00:07:17.415 --> 00:07:20.085
BUT LET'S BE HONEST NOW.

00:07:18.817 --> 00:07:21.954
NOT MANY OF HER CLAIMS WOULD

00:07:20.218 --> 00:07:22.621
HOLD UP IN AN ACTUAL COURT, THE

00:07:22.087 --> 00:07:23.522
ONE GOVERNED BY THE JUSTICE

00:07:22.754 --> 00:07:27.492
SYSTEM THAT WE THOUGHT WE HAD

00:07:23.655 --> 00:07:30.762
UNTIL ABOUT TEN DAYS AGO WHEN

00:07:27.626 --> 00:07:31.830
MAZIE HIRONO INFORMED US

00:07:31.597 --> 00:07:33.098
OTHERWISE.

00:07:31.964 --> 00:07:34.499
WHEN DID THIS TAKE PLACE?

00:07:33.232 --> 00:07:36.068
SHE DOESN'T KNOW.

00:07:34.633 --> 00:07:38.670
WHERE ARE THE WITNESSES TO THIS?

00:07:36.201 --> 00:07:40.305
THERE AREN'T ANY.

00:07:38.804 --> 00:07:40.939
WHEN WAS THIS FIRST REPORTED TO

00:07:40.672 --> 00:07:42.107
AUTHORITIES?

00:07:41.073 --> 00:07:44.076
IT NEVER REALLY WAS.

00:07:42.241 --> 00:07:46.511
THE STORY CAME OUT IN STAGES AND

00:07:44.209 --> 00:07:48.680
IT WAS A RECOVERED MEMORY.

00:07:46.645 --> 00:07:49.881
APPARENTLY SOMEONE BY A

00:07:48.981 --> 00:07:50.482
PSYCHOTHERAPIST 30 YEARS AFTER

00:07:50.015 --> 00:07:53.885
THE FACT.

00:07:50.616 --> 00:07:54.486
AND THEN IT WAS UNDER SIX YEARS

00:07:54.019 --> 00:07:56.555
BEFORE FORD NAMED BRETT

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:58.690
KAVANAUGH SPECIFICALLY WHEN HE

00:07:56.688 --> 00:07:59.458
WAS BEING NOMINATED FOR THE

00:07:58.824 --> 00:08:01.693
SUPREME COURT.

00:07:59.591 --> 00:08:03.395
THAT WAS THE POSITION AFFORDS A

00:08:01.827 --> 00:08:05.297
LAWYER ALL OF WHOM WHO DOUBLED

00:08:03.529 --> 00:08:07.032
AS THE DEMOCRATIC ACTIVISTS AND

00:08:05.597 --> 00:08:09.168
OPERATIVES, AND SOME OF WHOM

00:08:07.166 --> 00:08:12.704
IDENTIFIED BILL CLINTON FROM FAR

00:08:09.301 --> 00:08:13.705
GRAVER ASSAULTS THAT HE WAS

00:08:12.838 --> 00:08:16.375
ACCUSED OF.

00:08:13.839 --> 00:08:18.577
LAST WEEK FOR EXAMPLE, FOR TOLD

00:08:16.508 --> 00:08:20.179
SENATORS THAT SHE COULDN'T COME

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:21.847
TO WASHINGTON TO TESTIFY BECAUSE

00:08:20.312 --> 00:08:23.449
SHE WAS AFRAID TO FLY ON

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:24.550
AIRPLANES.

00:08:23.582 --> 00:08:27.019
THIS FEAR IS A DIRECT RESULT OF

00:08:24.683 --> 00:08:28.854
BEING GROPED OVER THE CLOSE BY

00:08:27.152 --> 00:08:30.789
BRETT KAVANAUGH IN HIGH SCHOOL

00:08:28.987 --> 00:08:32.858
IN THE 80s.

00:08:30.923 --> 00:08:33.592
AS ONE OF HER FRIENDS TOLD

00:08:32.991 --> 00:08:35.294
"THE WASHINGTON POST," AIRPLANE

00:08:33.725 --> 00:08:36.595
CABINS REMIND FORD OF THE

00:08:35.427 --> 00:08:38.697
TRAUMA, THEY ARE AN ENCLOSED

00:08:36.728 --> 00:08:39.698
SPACE WHERE YOU CAN'T GET AWAY.

00:08:38.831 --> 00:08:41.700
BUT IS THIS TRUE?

00:08:39.832 --> 00:08:42.301
FORD HAS RELATIVES ON THE

00:08:41.834 --> 00:08:44.269
